      <h2>Serving Assam</h2>
      <p>Fan Air India Pvt. Ltd. manufactures dry and wet scrubbers that remove pollutants from exhaust gases. For customers in Assam, our Dry &amp; Wet Scrubbers are commonly used for chemical, pharmaceutical, process and kitchen exhaust treatment.</p>
      <p>Assam&#x27;s industry ranges from tea processing units across the Brahmaputra valley to refineries, oil and gas installations, cement, food processing and a growing number of hospitals and commercial buildings in Guwahati. The state&#x27;s heavy monsoon and high humidity make corrosion-resistant construction and dependable ventilation especially important.</p>
      <p>Every unit is built at our factory in Neemrana, Rajasthan and selected to suit the required airflow, static pressure and site conditions of your project. Our team can help with sizing and technical data before you order, and we dispatch finished equipment to sites across Assam and the rest of India.</p>
      <p class="loc-seo__cta">To get a quotation for Dry &amp; Wet Scrubbers in Assam, share your airflow, pressure and application details through our <a href="../contact.php" title="Contact Fan Air India">contact page</a>, call <a href="tel:+919811347199" title="Call Fan Air India">+91-9811347199</a> or email <a href="mailto:saurabh.joshi@fanair.in" title="Email Fan Air India">saurabh.joshi@fanair.in</a>.</p>
